'''''Sagina  maritima''''' is a species of flowering plant in the family [[Caryophyllaceae]] known by the common name '''sea pearlwort'''.<ref>[http://www.irishwildflowers.ie/pages/367a.html sea pearlwort] Irish wildflowers</ref> It is found throughout [[Europe]], [[Southwest Asia]], [[North Africa]], the [[Canary Islands]] and the [[Azores]].<ref>{{cite web |title=Sagina maritima |url=http://www.floraiberica.es/floraiberica/texto/pdfs/02_049_25_Sagina.pdf |publisher=[[Flora Iberica]] |access-date=7 March 2022}}</ref>

